# What NOT to publish. The repository holds the source tree and the built site
# side by side; only the built site belongs on the web.
#
# Nothing secret lives in these paths (secrets are gitignored and never
# committed) - this is about weight and tidiness: without it every deploy
# uploads ~200 MB of engine source, migrations, design mock-ups and art
# masters that no player ever requests.

# --- source and tooling: built into assets/fo-*.js, never fetched directly ---
engine/
test/
tools/
resolver/
server/
supabase/
docs/
.build/
.github/
node_modules/
art-packs/

# --- design masters and mock-ups: not referenced by the running game --------
client/art/mockups/
client/art/src/

# --- repo furniture --------------------------------------------------------
.git/
.gitignore
build.sh
README.md
package.json
package-lock.json
wrangler.jsonc
.assetsignore
